[
  {
    "text": "阳光真好，照在身上暖洋洋的。",
    "emotion": "happy",
    "intensity": 0.48,
    "params": {
      "mouthSmileLeft": 0.28,
      "mouthSmileRight": 0.28,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.05,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.05,
      "browInnerUp": 0.02
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "路上看到一只小猫，冲我打了个滚。",
    "emotion": "happy",
    "intensity": 0.63,
    "params": {
      "mouthSmileLeft": 0.4,
      "mouthSmileRight": 0.42,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.15,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.14,
      "browInnerUp": 0.06
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "耳机里正好放到我最爱的那首歌。",
    "emotion": "happy",
    "intensity": 0.71,
    "params": {
      "mouthSmileLeft": 0.5,
      "mouthSmileRight": 0.49,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.2,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.2,
      "browInnerUp": 0.09
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "问题解决了，走路都轻快了不少。",
    "emotion": "happy",
    "intensity": 0.59,
    "params": {
      "mouthSmileLeft": 0.37,
      "mouthSmileRight": 0.36,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.1,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.11
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "窗外风铃响起来的时候，我突然觉得什么都很顺眼。",
    "emotion": "happy",
    "intensity": 0.66,
    "params": {
      "mouthSmileLeft": 0.44,
      "mouthSmileRight": 0.44,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.19,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.18,
      "browInnerUp": 0.08
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "朋友发来的消息让我忍不住笑出了声。",
    "emotion": "happy",
    "intensity": 0.85,
    "params": {
      "mouthSmileLeft": 0.61,
      "mouthSmileRight": 0.62,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.28,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.27,
      "browInnerUp": 0.13
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "看着窗台上的花开了，心里也跟着亮了一下。",
    "emotion": "happy",
    "intensity": 0.52,
    "params": {
      "mouthSmileLeft": 0.3,
      "mouthSmileRight": 0.31,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.07,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.08
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "雨下了一整天，感觉屋里也潮潮的。",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "intensity": 0.44,
    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.25,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.26,
      "browInnerUp": 0.22,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.09,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.1
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "翻看以前的照片，才发觉已经过去这么久了。",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "intensity": 0.67,
    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.44,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.45,
      "browInnerUp": 0.38,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.18,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.17
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "不想说话，只想一个人待着。",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "intensity": 0.79,
    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.54,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.53,
      "browInnerUp": 0.47,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.23,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.22
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "胸口有点闷，做什么都提不起兴趣。",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "intensity": 0.58,
    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.38,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.37,
      "browInnerUp": 0.32,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.15,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.14
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "明明很困，躺在床上却怎么也睡不着。",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "intensity": 0.62,
    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.41,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.4,
      "browInnerUp": 0.35,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.16,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.15
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "热闹是他们的，我好像什么都没有。",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "intensity": 0.73,
    "params": {
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.49,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.5,
      "browInnerUp": 0.44,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.19,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.2
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "我深吸了一口气，试着让自己别去想。",
    "emotion": "angry",
    "intensity": 0.48,
    "params": {
      "browDownLeft": 0.32,
      "browDownRight": 0.31,
      "mouthPressLeft": 0.24,
      "mouthPressRight": 0.23,
      "cheekPuff": 0.1
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "同样的错误，这已经是第三次了。",
    "emotion": "angry",
    "intensity": 0.69,
    "params": {
      "browDownLeft": 0.54,
      "browDownRight": 0.55,
      "mouthPressLeft": 0.4,
      "mouthPressRight": 0.41,
      "cheekPuff": 0.15
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "算了，不说了，说了也没用。",
    "emotion": "angry",
    "intensity": 0.61,
    "params": {
      "browDownLeft": 0.47,
      "browDownRight": 0.46,
      "mouthPressLeft": 0.35,
      "mouthPressRight": 0.34,
      "cheekPuff": 0.14
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "手不自觉地握紧了。",
    "emotion": "angry",
    "intensity": 0.53,
    "params": {
      "browDownLeft": 0.39,
      "browDownRight": 0.38,
      "mouthPressLeft": 0.29,
      "mouthPressRight": 0.28,
      "cheekPuff": 0.12
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "这借口编得也太敷衍了。",
    "emotion": "angry",
    "intensity": 0.77,
    "params": {
      "browDownLeft": 0.61,
      "browDownRight": 0.62,
      "mouthPressLeft": 0.47,
      "mouthPressRight": 0.48,
      "cheekPuff": 0.19
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "行，那就这样吧，没什么好说的了。",
    "emotion": "angry",
    "intensity": 0.86,
    "params": {
      "browDownLeft": 0.7,
      "browDownRight": 0.69,
      "mouthPressLeft": 0.54,
      "mouthPressRight": 0.53,
      "cheekPuff": 0.22
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "完全没想到会是这个结果。",
    "emotion": "surprise",
    "intensity": 0.51,
    "params": {
      "browOuterUpLeft": 0.33,
      "browOuterUpRight": 0.32,
      "eyeWideLeft": 0.43,
      "eyeWideRight": 0.44,
      "jawOpen": 0.24
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "等一下，让我缓一缓。",
    "emotion": "surprise",
    "intensity": 0.69,
    "params": {
      "browOuterUpLeft": 0.52,
      "browOuterUpRight": 0.53,
      "eyeWideLeft": 0.61,
      "eyeWideRight": 0.6,
      "jawOpen": 0.38
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "这也太巧了吧？",
    "emotion": "surprise",
    "intensity": 0.45,
    "params": {
      "browOuterUpLeft": 0.28,
      "browOuterUpRight": 0.29,
      "eyeWideLeft": 0.37,
      "eyeWideRight": 0.38,
      "jawOpen": 0.18
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "我是不是看错了？",
    "emotion": "surprise",
    "intensity": 0.58,
    "params": {
      "browOuterUpLeft": 0.42,
      "browOuterUpRight": 0.43,
      "eyeWideLeft": 0.52,
      "eyeWideRight": 0.51,
      "jawOpen": 0.3
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "哇，这简直像做梦一样。",
    "emotion": "surprise",
    "intensity": 0.81,
    "params": {
      "browOuterUpLeft": 0.63,
      "browOuterUpRight": 0.64,
      "eyeWideLeft": 0.71,
      "eyeWideRight": 0.7,
      "jawOpen": 0.47
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "突如其来，一点心理准备都没有。",
    "emotion": "surprise",
    "intensity": 0.73,
    "params": {
      "browOuterUpLeft": 0.56,
      "browOuterUpRight": 0.57,
      "eyeWideLeft": 0.64,
      "eyeWideRight": 0.65,
      "jawOpen": 0.41
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "这味道闻着就让人不舒服。",
    "emotion": "disgust",
    "intensity": 0.49,
    "params": {
      "browDownLeft": 0.27,
      "browDownRight": 0.28,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.29,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.3,
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.22,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.23,
      "cheekPuff": 0.1
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "我赶紧把头偏到了一边。",
    "emotion": "disgust",
    "intensity": 0.66,
    "params": {
      "browDownLeft": 0.37,
      "browDownRight": 0.38,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.39,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.4,
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.31,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.32,
      "cheekPuff": 0.13
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "别说了，我不想听细节。",
    "emotion": "disgust",
    "intensity": 0.71,
    "params": {
      "browDownLeft": 0.41,
      "browDownRight": 0.42,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.43,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.44,
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.35,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.36,
      "cheekPuff": 0.15
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "这也太不讲究了吧。",
    "emotion": "disgust",
    "intensity": 0.54,
    "params": {
      "browDownLeft": 0.31,
      "browDownRight": 0.32,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.33,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.32,
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.26,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.25,
      "cheekPuff": 0.11
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "感觉像吞了只苍蝇一样。",
    "emotion": "disgust",
    "intensity": 0.82,
    "params": {
      "browDownLeft": 0.46,
      "browDownRight": 0.47,
      "eyeSquintLeft": 0.5,
      "eyeSquintRight": 0.51,
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.41,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.42,
      "cheekPuff": 0.17
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "他今天怎么一直没回消息？",
    "emotion": "concern",
    "intensity": 0.41,
    "params": {
      "browInnerUp": 0.24,
      "eyeWideLeft": 0.15,
      "eyeWideRight": 0.16,
      "mouthPressLeft": 0.12,
      "mouthPressRight": 0.13
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "最近总是心慌，不知道是不是有什么事。",
    "emotion": "concern",
    "intensity": 0.68,
    "params": {
      "browInnerUp": 0.43,
      "eyeWideLeft": 0.27,
      "eyeWideRight": 0.28,
      "mouthPressLeft": 0.21,
      "mouthPressRight": 0.22
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "希望一切都顺利吧。",
    "emotion": "concern",
    "intensity": 0.56,
    "params": {
      "browInnerUp": 0.34,
      "eyeWideLeft": 0.2,
      "eyeWideRight": 0.21,
      "mouthPressLeft": 0.17,
      "mouthPressRight": 0.16
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "我再确认一遍，免得有遗漏。",
    "emotion": "concern",
    "intensity": 0.62,
    "params": {
      "browInnerUp": 0.38,
      "eyeWideLeft": 0.24,
      "eyeWideRight": 0.23,
      "mouthPressLeft": 0.19,
      "mouthPressRight": 0.18
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "看着外面天都黑了，他怎么还没到家。",
    "emotion": "concern",
    "intensity": 0.74,
    "params": {
      "browInnerUp": 0.46,
      "eyeWideLeft": 0.29,
      "eyeWideRight": 0.3,
      "mouthPressLeft": 0.23,
      "mouthPressRight": 0.24
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "心跳得好快，希望是我多想了。",
    "emotion": "concern",
    "intensity": 0.51,
    "params": {
      "browInnerUp": 0.31,
      "eyeWideLeft": 0.18,
      "eyeWideRight": 0.19,
      "mouthPressLeft": 0.15,
      "mouthPressRight": 0.14
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "窗外的树都数了好几遍了。",
    "emotion": "bored",
    "intensity": 0.45,
    "params": {
      "eyeLookDown": 0.2,
      "eyeLookLeft": 0.13,
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.09,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.1,
      "browDownLeft": 0.14,
      "browDownRight": 0.13
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "好想快点到点下班啊。",
    "emotion": "bored",
    "intensity": 0.58,
    "params": {
      "eyeLookDown": 0.26,
      "eyeLookLeft": 0.16,
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.11,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.12,
      "browDownLeft": 0.18,
      "browDownRight": 0.18
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "翻来覆去就这些内容，没一点新意。",
    "emotion": "bored",
    "intensity": 0.65,
    "params": {
      "eyeLookDown": 0.29,
      "eyeLookLeft": 0.19,
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.14,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.13,
      "browDownLeft": 0.22,
      "browDownRight": 0.21
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "我在纸上随手画着什么，自己都不知道在画什么。",
    "emotion": "bored",
    "intensity": 0.48,
    "params": {
      "eyeLookDown": 0.21,
      "eyeLookLeft": 0.14,
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.09,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.1,
      "browDownLeft": 0.15,
      "browDownRight": 0.14
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "时间过得真慢啊。",
    "emotion": "bored",
    "intensity": 0.72,
    "params": {
      "eyeLookDown": 0.33,
      "eyeLookLeft": 0.22,
      "mouthFrownLeft": 0.15,
      "mouthFrownRight": 0.16,
      "browDownLeft": 0.24,
      "browDownRight": 0.25
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "夜深了，只听得见自己的呼吸声。",
    "emotion": "calm",
    "intensity": 0.42,
    "params": {
      "mouthSmileLeft": 0.04,
      "mouthSmileRight": 0.04
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "泡了杯茶，看着热气慢慢升起来。",
    "emotion": "calm",
    "intensity": 0.57,
    "params": {
      "mouthSmileLeft": 0.06,
      "mouthSmileRight": 0.07
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "把事情一件件理清楚，感觉好多了。",
    "emotion": "calm",
    "intensity": 0.68,
    "params": {
      "mouthSmileLeft": 0.08,
      "mouthSmileRight": 0.09
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "雨停了，空气里有一股清新的味道。",
    "emotion": "calm",
    "intensity": 0.48,
    "params": {
      "mouthSmileLeft": 0.05,
      "mouthSmileRight": 0.05
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "什么都不想，就这样发会呆也挺好。",
    "emotion": "calm",
    "intensity": 0.61,
    "params": {
      "mouthSmileLeft": 0.07,
      "mouthSmileRight": 0.06
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "终于忙完了，可以好好休息一下了。",
    "emotion": "calm",
    "intensity": 0.53,
    "params": {
      "mouthSmileLeft": 0.05,
      "mouthSmileRight": 0.06
    }
  }
]